OL,3,GNEWSAChild rapist with hundreds of
OL,4,Aabuse images of same girl jailed for 21
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been jailed for dozens of sex
OL,8,Foffences, including rape, against a
OL,9,Fteenage girl.
OL,11,FJordan Richards, from Kidderminster,
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to charges including 31
OL,13,Fcounts of rape and the production of
OL,14,Fmore than 600 indecent images of the
OL,15,Fsame child.
OL,17,FThe offences occurred near Ammanford,
OL,18,FCarmarthenshire, between 2012 and 2016,
OL,19,FDyfed-Powys Police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
